---
title: Marks that span lines
---
# Marks that span lines

An addition with a line break: {author="Claude (editor)" date="2026-10-30"++first new line
second new line++} and on.

An addition that adds a paragraph: {author="Claude (editor)" date="2026-10-30"++end of this paragraph.

A whole new paragraph.++} Back to the old text.

A substitution whose new text has a break: {author="Claude (editor)" date="2026-10-30"~~one line~>line one
line two~~} done.

A comment over two lines.{author="Claude (checker)" date="2026-10-30">>First line of the comment.
Second line of the comment.<<}
